## 1. Acceptance of Terms

By downloading, installing, or using AxisForge ("the Software"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree, do not use the Software.

These Terms apply to both the free version and the Pro subscription tier. Use of the Pro tier is additionally governed by the Paddle subscription agreement presented at checkout.

---

## 2. Description of Software

AxisForge is a Linux joystick remapping tool that reads input from physical HID devices and emits remapped input to virtual joystick devices via the Linux kernel's UHID subsystem. It includes an optional AI profile assistant, audio playback, and a hosted Pro tier.

