**YOU ARE SOLELY RESPONSIBLE FOR ENSURING YOUR USE OF AXISFORGE COMPLIES WITH THE TERMS OF SERVICE OF ANY GAME OR APPLICATION YOU USE IT WITH.**

Many online games deploy anti-cheat software (including but not limited to Valve Anti-Cheat, Easy Anti-Cheat, BattlEye, and proprietary systems). Input remapping software may be detected by, or violate the terms of, such systems. Possible consequences include:

- Temporary or permanent bans from games or online services
- Loss of in-game items, currency, or progress
- Account suspension

**AxisForge and its developers are not responsible for any game bans, account suspensions, item losses, or any other consequences resulting from your use of this Software with any game or online service.**

It is your responsibility to verify that input remapping is permitted by the relevant game's Terms of Service before use in any online or competitive context.

