## 5. AI Assistant Disclaimer

AxisForge includes an AI profile assistant that generates TOML configuration suggestions. You acknowledge that:

- AI-generated outputs may be incorrect, incomplete, or unsuitable for your use case
- All AI suggestions must be reviewed by you before being applied to your profile
- AxisForge makes no warranty that AI-generated configurations will function as described or produce any particular result
- The AI assistant uses third-party API providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, or user-configured endpoints); AxisForge is not responsible for the availability, accuracy, or content of responses from those providers
- When using the hosted Pro tier, your messages are proxied through AxisForge's servers to the AI provider; no message content is stored beyond the duration of the API call

---

