## 7. Pro Subscription

Pro subscriptions are processed by Paddle, who acts as the Merchant of Record. By subscribing you also agree to Paddle's terms and conditions.

- Subscriptions auto-renew until cancelled
- Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period
- Refunds are governed by Paddle's refund policy; as a general policy, refunds may be requested within 14 days of purchase if the hosted AI tier has not been used
- Free trials, where offered, convert to paid subscriptions automatically unless cancelled before the trial period ends
- AxisForge reserves the right to modify Pro tier pricing and features with 30 days' notice to subscribers

---

## 8. Privacy

AxisForge collects no personal data from free-tier users. The Software operates entirely on your local machine.

For Pro subscribers:
- Your Paddle license key is stored locally in `~/.config/axisforge/config.toml`
- AI chat messages are transmitted to our proxy server solely for the purpose of forwarding to the AI provider; they are not stored or logged
- No usage data, profile contents, or device information is transmitted to AxisForge servers without your explicit action

